{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1642420/extras/805dc232b9d03686b66296a77fdbc7eb.poster.avif?t=1666996290\" width=616 height=101 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1642420/extras/805dc232b9d03686b66296a77fdbc7eb.webm?t=1666996290\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>Fat Cat wants his rent and the only way to get it is deep in the mines. In this 2D sidescrolling strategy/resource management game, excavate and traverse your underground mine shafts to retrieve gold! Go into the mines and extract as much gold as you can. Setup your operation and reinvest your earnings into better gear and equipment to mine more gold and win the game! This line of work not only separates the gold from the dirt, but the pups from the dogs. With danger lurking in these ancient grounds, hungry Dinos awaken, searching for prey and loot. The wise miner doesn\u2019t fear the Dino but sees it\u2019s flesh and bones as a potential fuel source for their operations. Gold mining is a treasure hunt, so open your miner\u2019s map, test some dirt, and find that stash of gold!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1642420/extras/7ee5382d42b4f0d383bf0e05c9564949.poster.avif?t=1666996290\" width=616 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1642420/extras/7ee5382d42b4f0d383bf0e05c9564949.webm?t=1666996290\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1642420/extras/7ee5382d42b4f0d383bf0e05c9564949.mp4?t=1666996290\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>YOUR TASK</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Pan Dirt </li><li>Mine Gold</li><li>Smelt Coins</li><li>Make Rent</li></ul><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1642420/extras/50528f35371cfa3e202771392dce4470.avif?t=1666996290\" width=616 height=192 /></span><br>Dogs like to move it. You name it they'll carry it for you.<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Ore</li><li>Gold Rich Dirt</li><li>Coins</li><li>Puppies</li><li>Flamables</li><li>Dino Prisoners</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1642420/extras/f0c7c2f75601ad60f529923be124908a.avif?t=1666996290\" width=616 height=90 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1642420/extras/7d30c6163ebbda31afeaafc41ac32973.poster.avif?t=1666996290\" width=616 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1642420/extras/7d30c6163ebbda31afeaafc41ac32973.webm?t=1666996290\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1642420/extras/7d30c6163ebbda31afeaafc41ac32973.mp4?t=1666996290\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Family</li><li>Resources</li><li>House</li><li>Mine Shaft</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Beware of Dinos</strong></h2><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1642420/extras/eeb4b141248c42a23b2e914fa481c16b.avif?t=1666996290\" width=616 height=90 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Routes</li><li>Family Business</li><li>Finances</li><li>Time</li><li>Resources</li></ul><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Rent is due at the end of every month</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline cros